# A change to these paths needs a review from a plugin owner: they define what every agent and
# page does, and docs/STANDARD.md is the checklist a reviewer holds them to. The develop branch
# protection requires a code-owner review (docs/PLUGIN-LIFECYCLE.md section 11).
# Later lines win, so keep the narrow paths below the broad ones.

/plugins/aspire/agents/ @aspire-atlas/admin
/plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md                @aspire-atlas/admin
/plugins/aspire/skills/aspire/references/   @aspire-atlas/admin
/plugins/aspire/skills/page-standard/       @aspire-atlas/admin
/scripts/               @aspire-atlas/admin
/docs/STANDARD.md       @aspire-atlas/admin
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @aspire-atlas/admin
